@startuml
title SD-S03 — Durable work and dispatch
caption To-Be · Worker and Notification · F04/F06/F07 · TX-08
[*] --> Ready : domain effect + durable intent
Ready --> Leased : claim fenced batch
Leased --> Ready : eligible retry or lease timeout
Leased --> Succeeded : owning transition or verified dispatch
Leased --> Dead : terminal or unknown external outcome
Dead --> Ready : operator authorizes reconciled replay
Succeeded --> [*]
note right of Leased : External I/O runs outside database locks
@enduml
